    title: "Seven Gazans wounded, one critically, in Israeli gunfire and airstrikes",
    summary: "Seven Gazans wounded, one critically, in Israeli gunfire and airstrikes Seven Palestinians were injured, one of them critically, in Israeli gunfire and airstrikes across Gaza on Saturday morning, Wafa reported. Two Palestinians were shot by Israeli forces in displacement camps in the town of Jabalia, north of the Strip, while a woman and a child were wounded after tanks opened heavy fire towards tents for the displaced people in the Al-Mawasi area of Khan Younis, in southern Gaza, Wafa said. Meanwhile, three Palestinians were injured, one of them critically, in an Israeli airstrike targeting an area south of Al-Mawasi in Khan Younis. According to Gaza health authorities, more than 1,600 Palestinians have been killed and over 6,000 wounded since the ceasefire began in October last year. Breaking | Three Palestinians were injured, including one in critical condition, after Israeli forces targeted Al-Tahrir Nursery Street, south of the Al-Mawasi area in Khan Younis. https://t.co/nTDZ2zbw5y — Quds News Network (@QudsNen) November 21, 2026",
